{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_title", "source_sha256": "d0f5954f1cd2a2669b75418a7025f9e0f9800861ed766754c589bdd9b827d9fa", "ja": "飛ぶ蝶を追いかけて", "zh": "追赶飞舞的蝴蝶", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_synopsis", "source_sha256": "c19339897e67d18a708d8cfd29da3871efef070cb1f812766e481d65405019c9", "ja": "美希攻略の糸口が掴めず困惑するエレナ。\nこのみの「相手をよく知ることが大切」と\nいうアドバイスに従い作戦を練ることに。\n話し合いに熱中するエレナ達だったが、\n美希はそれをひとり遠目に見守っていた。", "zh": "艾蕾娜苦恼于找不到攻略美希的突破口。她听从了这美的“了解对方非常重要”的建议，决定制定作战计划。艾蕾娜等人热火朝天地讨论着，美希却独自一人在远处默默地看着她们。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1000_p", "source_sha256": "eeb007bf1f0d47368031accf40bfebfdc01ac9a2dca8c4b3956b466f7cca81a2", "ja": "（今日は丸1日、出張しての打ち合わせだ。皆の事は\nこのみさんに頼んだし、大丈夫だとは思うけど……）", "zh": "（今天要出差整整1天去开会。大家就拜托给木实姐了，应该没问题，不过……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1001_018ele", "source_sha256": "2cbccf6feac07955975394716f1feef6723bff26ce31d3ea4fc3eb418cfcb608", "ja": "それでネ、収録を見せてもらったんだけど……\nミキ、すごかったんだヨ～！", "zh": "然后呢，我去现场看了录制……美希真的好厉害呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1002_033sih", "source_sha256": "b581c58fb4875dd381fb808f55c17ea177f3accc1b55f5cbfd37437f196a6c3e", "ja": "昨日、テレビで見ました。美希さん、\nすごいパフォーマンスでしたね……。", "zh": "昨天，我在电视上看到了。美希小姐的表演真的很精彩……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1003_018ele", "source_sha256": "63d65783cf480322e9977a09959343e77023ae9ca880fe1814eeefb075dd3a20", "ja": "でしょ！？　だから今度のデュオも、ワタシがミキに\n合わせられたら、すごいステージになると思うノ！", "zh": "对吧！？所以这次的双人表演，要是我能配合好美希的话，我觉得一定会成为超棒的舞台哦！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1004_018ele", "source_sha256": "721233a1dba4671e047d25968ade5e1f13b6a5cf32b32c8b0cbbc30ca6fc34c0", "ja": "でも、ミキは相変わらずっていうか……どうしたら\nミキがワタシを見てくれるか、全然わからないヨ～！", "zh": "不过，美希还是老样子……该怎么做才能让美希注意到我，我完全不知道呀～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1005_039kon", "source_sha256": "0146ffb9f3c5951d9590dcec18cb38ee844cdced213047c244882308363d4b43", "ja": "わからない、か……あ！", "zh": "不知道吗……啊！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1006_050jul", "source_sha256": "a2010b9f973db6ecb4bde36c7424475be025736ba5dcf1382affefc530776054", "ja": "このみ姉、何かわかったのか？", "zh": "这不就是本身的意思吗？生硬的回答呀……呃！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1007_039kon", "source_sha256": "d7a1378380bac03030b117c4ed3019cce33769a00ad1ad2ade1e47351af87147", "ja": "あ、ううん。根本的な話なんだけど……。", "zh": "啊，不是。只是想说个根本性的问题……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1008_039kon", "source_sha256": "0567248a06a92365d7d66813963263baabd284f61d4db1e766cb49e599801d5d", "ja": "もしかしたら……私たちのほうこそ、\n美希ちゃんのことをよく知らないのかも、って。", "zh": "说不定……反倒是我们，\n其实并不太了解美希呢。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1009_033sih", "source_sha256": "7853e5ae70b9979c519d644fbd9f8701e0a8c8b1eb51ac58bac5394faa543493", "ja": "知らない……？\n私たちが、美希さんのことを？", "zh": "不了解……？\n我们，不了解美希小姐？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1010_050jul", "source_sha256": "d2714ea9b82b8afaf9a5c1c5374583150a10ecd7127e804549613d1db2753eb1", "ja": "なるほどな。相手を深く知っていたほうが、\n攻略の糸口が見つかるかもしれない、ってことか。", "zh": "原来如此。也就是说，只有深入了解对方，\n才有可能找到突破口，对吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1011_039kon", "source_sha256": "ff3cb7e414271bc86f80f9864534eac9df61a1d561aa882f5976c8a937a63910", "ja": "ええ。それにお互いを知るのって、\nデュオをやる上でも大事なことだと思うわ。", "zh": "是的。而且我觉得，想要组成二人组合，了解彼此也是很重要的。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1012_039kon", "source_sha256": "6cdc4cc70f23e88136c4a78b8a3463e2ec5334a3c444b870d1fa62f5badd9576", "ja": "どうかしら、エレナちゃん。", "zh": "你觉得怎么样，艾蕾娜？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1013_018ele", "source_sha256": "aaf51a681fe4ada1ed0ffaba940f43e505f6039e83a9d9fb0397f52bba123d40", "ja": "ミキのことをよく知る……わかった！\nワタシ、やってみるヨ～！", "zh": "深入了解美希……明白了！\n我来试试看～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1014_018ele", "source_sha256": "a0c02a3097aa5ee91d28bf8e4adb699a9e12effa2baea30fa50e80d0dab73c96", "ja": "えっと、ミキの明日の予定は……。", "zh": "那个，美希明天的安排是……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1015_018ele", "source_sha256": "d78f5ff90dcfd5cb18e2ed07fb7f9684fd1c1361e76b63ba771e486dc5ffa257", "ja": "午前中は取材で、午後は撮影だって！\nミキ、毎日忙しそう……。", "zh": "听说上午要采访，下午要拍摄！\n美希每天好像都很忙……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1016_033sih", "source_sha256": "65c06c3a26c75fc49b199f53d1bd41da0c13da47d1de2845ca9a891395c6e6be", "ja": "あの、エレナさん。どうして\n美希さんのスケジュールを知ってるんですか？", "zh": "那个，艾蕾娜。你为什么会知道美希的日程安排？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1017_018ele", "source_sha256": "c669ce0e9cc4885afd4f8be47226323dd6177c209feeee5651b0dc1178df7d04", "ja": "{$P$}に聞いたんだヨ！　メグミと\nコトハに、ミキと会えないって話をしたんだけど……。", "zh": "我去问了{$P$}哦！我跟惠和琴叶说了见不到美希这件事……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1018_018ele", "source_sha256": "372dd1d9a2e552af71d8591d321943c710b4b36778b1dd304550d5022c903095", "ja": "そうしたら「会いたい時は、相手のスケジュールを\n把握すればいい」って教えてくれたノ！", "zh": "然后他告诉我：“想见面的时候，只要掌握对方的日程安排就好了！”", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1019_050jul", "source_sha256": "bb022e483f76a9229bb3d860603fa21902b5549fc04ca438a7b0c7c5dd8e034a", "ja": "スケジュールを把握……。\nなんか、それって手口がスト………。", "zh": "掌握日程……。\n怎么感觉，这就像是跟踪……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1020_039kon", "source_sha256": "f55f8ba95a08c276c7e9e89f2806f7e6e0a8996eaeeddcd868a9c686eb86cc8e", "ja": "しーっ！　方向性は間違いじゃないはずだから。\nたぶん……！", "zh": "嘘——！　方向性は没错的。\n大概……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1022_003mik", "source_sha256": "a9ec2c83ad31b574551bfa61d62dd86bebbd89cccf5ef69ceb3c254ba184d86f", "ja": "おはようございますなの。\nあれ、みんなもう集まってる……。", "zh": "早上好喵。\n咦，大家已经都到齐了……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1023_050jul", "source_sha256": "f3a8a39d51be2fde3c371b83da37c93e36bd856fe773d7aaed920cffdc8f1a34", "ja": "いや、流石に待ち伏せはやりすぎなんじゃないか？\nファンじゃないんだから……。", "zh": "不过，再怎么说，埋伏也有点太过分了吧？\n我们又不是粉丝……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1024_039kon", "source_sha256": "1976aace010b151e75a5bef3302d5295378359db89486dd7820a825a6427b086", "ja": "いいえ、むしろファンと間違われていたほうが、\n好都合かもしれないわ……！", "zh": "不，倒不如说，被误认为是粉丝可能更方便……！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1025_033sih", "source_sha256": "3f514aa7888af9b5bcfb5c5675ec340bd785f733afeebe686e6acfdc70dc13d6", "ja": "あの、考え方が本当にスト……\nそういう方向性になっているような……。", "zh": "那个，总觉得你的想法真的像跟踪……\n像是在往那种方向靠拢了……。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1026_003mik", "source_sha256": "cca5b9f14036ec9931082b2dc6eeec743e7d4503bfd7bea4420b37b56e89014e", "ja": "……？\nみんな、どうしたの？　何の話？", "zh": "……？\n大家怎么啦？在聊什么呢？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1027_033sih", "source_sha256": "5d8913365ca3cf39c508bccb27310330e7eeda851f9d152797bba777926c333d", "ja": "あ、美希さん！\nおはようございます。", "zh": "啊，美希小姐！\n早上好。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1028_018ele", "source_sha256": "52e1d4421bc681093c2a442bb4d52a11476e62c67e84e1080e5bb0b5aa30c3ef", "ja": "ミキ、おはよっ！\n昨日のテレビ、観たヨ～！", "zh": "美希，早上好！\n我看了你昨天的电视节目哦～！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1029_003mik", "source_sha256": "09f0d04cff8d74767b518e87454a8c13a1db8019adccc951aea366795d197ab4", "ja": "エレナってば、収録見てたのに、テレビも見たの？\nよく飽きないね。", "zh": "艾丽娜明明都看过录制现场了，居然连电视也看了？\n真是不嫌腻啊。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1030_018ele", "source_sha256": "58c39beb7064e59e125af89243a1452b21666c9eca00b9cdd386fd13c3e406f5", "ja": "飽きないヨ！\nそれにこれから、ミキのこと徹底調査……。", "zh": "不会腻的哦！而且接下来，我要彻底调查一下美希……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1031_050jul", "source_sha256": "336fa49089171b9bba8ea38a924969954d0e473d5ce1e7236afe30e6c20097e7", "ja": "わーっ！！！", "zh": "哇——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1032_039kon", "source_sha256": "336fa49089171b9bba8ea38a924969954d0e473d5ce1e7236afe30e6c20097e7", "ja": "わーっ！！！", "zh": "哇——！！！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1033_003mik", "source_sha256": "8d96943233bdc1bd7684c433dc08ab17436cf48c5719f3fd4ef8790af51a9ff5", "ja": "キャッ！　……なに？", "zh": "呀！……怎么了？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "event_0208_story_04_jp.gtx", "item_key": "event_0208_story_04_1034_039kon", "source_sha256": "ed63253214f746995c60b6928d84172efa3004be39765d22aebc5ce496e5051e", "ja": "な、なんでもないのよ、美希ちゃん！\nさぁ、レッスン始めましょう！", "zh": "没、没什么啦，美希！\n好了，我们开始练习吧！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
